msgid ""
"Lists every key in your keyring, grouped into \"My keys\" (a secret key "
"is available) and \"Other keys\" (public only). The unlabeled column "
"between Name and Email shows whether a personal key's passphrase is "
"currently remembered: unlocked if so, locked otherwise. Double-click that"
" icon to forget a remembered passphrase."
msgstr ""
"Lists every key in your keyring, grouped into \"My keys\" (a secret key "
"is available) and \"Other keys\" (public only). The unlabeled column "
"between Name and Email shows whether a personal key's passphrase is "
"currently remembered: unlocked if so, locked otherwise. Double-click that"
" icon to forget a remembered passphrase."

