msgid "Configure the interface language"
msgstr "Configure the interface language"

msgid ""
"Configure the interface language, the default algorithm for new keys, the"
" toolbar icon size, and how long a passphrase you enter is remembered "
"before it's forgotten again."
msgstr ""
"Configure the interface language, the default algorithm for new keys, the"
" toolbar icon size, and how long a passphrase you enter is remembered "
"before it's forgotten again."

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Quit"

msgid "Quit PBNightingale"
msgstr "Quit PBNightingale"

msgid "Exit the application"
msgstr "Exit the application"

msgid ""
"Closes PBNightingale. There is nothing to save first — every change is "
"applied directly to your GPG keyring as you make it, so no operation "
"already done is undone by quitting."
msgstr ""
"Closes PBNightingale. There is nothing to save first — every change is "
"applied directly to your GPG keyring as you make it, so no operation "
"already done is undone by quitting."

msgid "About this application"
msgstr "About this application"

msgid "Show version and license information"
msgstr "Show version and license information"

msgid ""
"Shows the application's version, author and license (GPLv3 for the code; "
"the bundled icons are separately licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)."
msgstr ""
"Shows the application's version, author and license (GPLv3 for the code; "
"the bundled icons are separately licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)."

msgid "Reset toolbars"
msgstr "Reset toolbars"

msgid "Restore the default toolbar positions and visibility"
msgstr "Restore the default toolbar positions and visibility"

msgid ""
"Restores every toolbar to its position, order and visibility from the "
"very first run — handy after moving or hiding one by accident."
msgstr ""
"Restores every toolbar to its position, order and visibility from the "
"very first run — handy after moving or hiding one by accident."

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Refresh"

msgid "Reload the key list from the keyring"
msgstr "Reload the key list from the keyring"

msgid ""
"Reloads the key list from your GPG keyring, picking up any change made "
"outside PBNightingale (e.g. via the gpg command line)."
msgstr ""
"Reloads the key list from your GPG keyring, picking up any change made "
"outside PBNightingale (e.g. via the gpg command line)."

msgid "New key…"
msgstr "New key…"

msgid "Create a new personal key pair"
msgstr "Create a new personal key pair"

msgid ""
"Opens the wizard to generate a brand-new personal key pair (RSA or "
"Ed25519), including its own passphrase."
msgstr ""
"Opens the wizard to generate a brand-new personal key pair (RSA or "
"Ed25519), including its own passphrase."

msgid "Add subkey…"
msgstr "Add subkey…"

msgid "Add a signing, encryption or authentication subkey"
msgstr "Add a signing, encryption or authentication subkey"

msgid ""
"Adds a new subkey to the selected personal key, for signing, encryption "
"or authentication — useful for giving each purpose its own key without "
"touching the primary one."
msgstr ""
"Adds a new subkey to the selected personal key, for signing, encryption "
"or authentication — useful for giving each purpose its own key without "
"touching the primary one."

msgid "Set key expiration…"
msgstr "Set key expiration…"

msgid "Set this key's expiration date"
msgstr "Set this key's expiration date"

msgid "Sets or removes the selected key's own expiration date."
msgstr "Sets or removes the selected key's own expiration date."

msgid "Revoke key…"
msgstr "Revoke key…"

msgid "Revoke this key (requires confirmation)"
msgstr "Revoke this key (requires confirmation)"

msgid ""
"Permanently revokes the selected personal key itself, marking it "
"untrustworthy from now on. This cannot be undone — the key still exists, "
"but should no longer be used or trusted."
msgstr ""
"Permanently revokes the selected personal key itself, marking it "
"untrustworthy from now on. This cannot be undone — the key still exists, "
"but should no longer be used or trusted."

msgid "Set subkey expiration…"
msgstr "Set subkey expiration…"

msgid "Set the selected subkey's expiration date"
msgstr "Set the selected subkey's expiration date"

msgid ""
"Sets or removes the selected subkey's expiration date, independently of "
"the primary key's own expiration."
msgstr ""
"Sets or removes the selected subkey's expiration date, independently of "
"the primary key's own expiration."

msgid "Add user ID…"
msgstr "Add user ID…"

msgid "Add a new identity (name and email)"
msgstr "Add a new identity (name and email)"

msgid ""
"Adds another identity (name and email address) to the selected personal "
"key — e.g. a second address you also want this key to vouch for."
msgstr ""
"Adds another identity (name and email address) to the selected personal "
"key — e.g. a second address you also want this key to vouch for."

msgid "Set as primary…"
msgstr "Set as primary…"

msgid "Set the selected user ID as the primary identity"
msgstr "Set the selected user ID as the primary identity"

msgid ""
"Marks the selected identity as the key's primary one — the identity other"
" tools show by default for this key."
msgstr ""
"Marks the selected identity as the key's primary one — the identity other"
" tools show by default for this key."

msgid "Revoke user ID…"
msgstr "Revoke user ID…"

msgid "Revoke the selected user ID (requires confirmation)"
msgstr "Revoke the selected user ID (requires confirmation)"

msgid ""
"Permanently revokes the selected identity. At least one non-revoked "
"identity must remain on the key."
msgstr ""
"Permanently revokes the selected identity. At least one non-revoked "
"identity must remain on the key."

msgid "Add photo…"
msgstr "Add photo…"

msgid "Add a photo user ID"
msgstr "Add a photo user ID"

msgid ""
"Attaches a photo to the selected personal key, as an extra (visual) "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"Attaches a photo to the selected personal key, as an extra (visual) "
"identity."

msgid "Revoke photo…"
msgstr "Revoke photo…"

msgid "Revoke the selected photo (requires confirmation)"
msgstr "Revoke the selected photo (requires confirmation)"

msgid "Permanently revokes the selected photo."
msgstr "Permanently revokes the selected photo."

msgid "Import…"
msgstr "Import…"

msgid "Import a key from a file or a keyserver"
msgstr "Import a key from a file or a keyserver"

msgid ""
"Imports a key from a local file, or fetches one from a keyserver by "
"fingerprint, key ID or email address."
msgstr ""
"Imports a key from a local file, or fetches one from a keyserver by "
"fingerprint, key ID or email address."

msgid "Export…"
msgstr "Export…"

msgid "Export the selected key to a file"
msgstr "Export the selected key to a file"

msgid ""
"Saves the selected key's public part to a file, to share with someone "
"else. Does not include any private key material."
msgstr ""
"Saves the selected key's public part to a file, to share with someone "
"else. Does not include any private key material."

msgid "Back up private key…"
msgstr "Back up private key…"

msgid "Export the selected key's private key material to a file"
msgstr "Export the selected key's private key material to a file"

msgid ""
"Saves the selected key's full private key material to a file — a real "
"backup, unlike Export. Requires the key's passphrase; anyone with this "
"file and its passphrase can fully impersonate the key."
msgstr ""
"Saves the selected key's full private key material to a file — a real "
"backup, unlike Export. Requires the key's passphrase; anyone with this "
"file and its passphrase can fully impersonate the key."

msgid "Change passphrase…"
msgstr "Change passphrase…"

msgid "Change the passphrase protecting this key's private key material"
msgstr "Change the passphrase protecting this key's private key material"

msgid ""
"Changes the passphrase protecting the selected key's private key "
"material. Requires the current passphrase."
msgstr ""
"Changes the passphrase protecting the selected key's private key "
"material. Requires the current passphrase."

msgid "Delete…"
msgstr "Delete…"

msgid "Delete the selected key"
msgstr "Delete the selected key"

msgid ""
"Permanently removes the selected key from your keyring, including any "
"private key material. Requires strong confirmation, since this cannot be "
"undone — unlike revoking, the key won't exist at all afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Permanently removes the selected key from your keyring, including any "
"private key material. Requires strong confirmation, since this cannot be "
"undone — unlike revoking, the key won't exist at all afterwards."

msgid "Copy ID"
msgstr "Copy ID"

msgid "Copy the selected key's fingerprint to the clipboard"
msgstr "Copy the selected key's fingerprint to the clipboard"

msgid "Copies the selected key's full fingerprint to the clipboard."
msgstr "Copies the selected key's full fingerprint to the clipboard."

msgid "Copy the selected subkey's fingerprint to the clipboard"
msgstr "Copy the selected subkey's fingerprint to the clipboard"

msgid "Copies the selected subkey's full fingerprint to the clipboard."
msgstr "Copies the selected subkey's full fingerprint to the clipboard."

msgid "Copy email"
msgstr "Copy email"

msgid "Copy the selected identity's email address to the clipboard"
msgstr "Copy the selected identity's email address to the clipboard"

msgid ""
"Copies the selected identity's email address to the clipboard, if it has "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Copies the selected identity's email address to the clipboard, if it has "
"one."

msgid "Show"
msgstr "Show"

msgid "View the selected photo full-size"
msgstr "View the selected photo full-size"

msgid ""
"Opens the selected photo in a viewer, at full size — same as double-"
"clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Opens the selected photo in a viewer, at full size — same as double-"
"clicking it."

msgid "Sign key…"
msgstr "Sign key…"

msgid "Sign another key to build the web of trust"
msgstr "Sign another key to build the web of trust"

msgid ""
"Signs the selected key with one of your own keys, vouching that its "
"identity binding is genuine — the basis of the web of trust."
msgstr ""
"Signs the selected key with one of your own keys, vouching that its "
"identity binding is genuine — the basis of the web of trust."

msgid "Set owner trust…"
msgstr "Set owner trust…"

msgid "Set how much you trust this key's owner to certify others"
msgstr "Set how much you trust this key's owner to certify others"

msgid ""
"Sets how much you personally trust the selected key's owner to correctly "
"vouch for other people's keys. This is a private, local judgment — it "
"isn't published anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Sets how much you personally trust the selected key's owner to correctly "
"vouch for other people's keys. This is a private, local judgment — it "
"isn't published anywhere."

msgid "Revoke subkey…"
msgstr "Revoke subkey…"

msgid "Revoke a subkey (requires confirmation)"
msgstr "Revoke a subkey (requires confirmation)"

msgid ""
"Permanently revokes the selected subkey. Unlike revoking the whole key, "
"the primary key and its other subkeys remain usable."
msgstr ""
"Permanently revokes the selected subkey. Unlike revoking the whole key, "
"the primary key and its other subkeys remain usable."

msgid "Refresh trust"
msgstr "Refresh trust"

msgid "Recompute the web of trust"
msgstr "Recompute the web of trust"

msgid ""
"Recomputes every key's validity from its current signatures — useful "
"after signing a key, or importing new signatures, since validity isn't "
"recalculated automatically."
msgstr ""
"Recomputes every key's validity from its current signatures — useful "
"after signing a key, or importing new signatures, since validity isn't "
"recalculated automatically."

msgid "Search…"
msgstr "Search…"

msgid "Search a keyserver by fingerprint, key ID or email"
msgstr "Search a keyserver by fingerprint, key ID or email"

msgid ""
"Searches a keyserver by name, email address, fingerprint or key ID, and "
"lets you import one of the matching keys."
msgstr ""
"Searches a keyserver by name, email address, fingerprint or key ID, and "
"lets you import one of the matching keys."

msgid "Publish…"
msgstr "Publish…"

msgid "Publish the selected key to a keyserver"
msgstr "Publish the selected key to a keyserver"

msgid ""
"Publishes the selected key to a keyserver, making it publicly retrievable"
" by anyone. A published key generally cannot be fully removed again "
"afterwards, only revoked."
msgstr ""
"Publishes the selected key to a keyserver, making it publicly retrievable"
" by anyone. A published key generally cannot be fully removed again "
"afterwards, only revoked."

msgid "Refresh keys from their keyserver"
msgstr "Refresh keys from their keyserver"

msgid ""
"Re-downloads the selected key, or every key in your keyring, from its "
"keyserver, picking up new signatures, identities or revocations."
msgstr ""
